    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-002",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: To the...Half?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Graph the function yourself. What estimate do you get for \\(9^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\)?",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-003",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: To the...Half?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Using the properties of exponents, Clare evaluated \\(9^{\\frac12} \\boldcdot 9^{\\frac12}\\). What did she get?",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-004",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: To the...Half?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "For that to be true, what must the value of \\(9^{\\frac12}\\) be?",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-005",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: To the...Half?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Clare said, “I know that \\(9^2 = 9 \\boldcdot 9\\), \\(9^1 = 9\\), and \\(9^0 = 1\\). I wonder what \\(9^{\\frac12}\\) means?” First, she graphed \\(y = 9^x\\) for some whole number values of \\(x\\), and estimated \\(9^{\\frac12}\\) from the graph.",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-006",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: To the...Half?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Graph the function yourself. What estimate do you get for \\(3^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\)?",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-007",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: To the...Half?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Next he used exponent rules to find the value of \\(\\left (3^{\\frac12}\\right)^2\\). What did he find?",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-008",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: To the...Half?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Then he said, “That looks like a root!” What do you think he means?",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-009",
      "SourceSection": "3.2: To the...Half?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Diego saw Clare’s work and said, “Now I’m wondering about \\(3^{\\frac12}\\).” First he graphed \\(y = 3^x\\) for some whole number values of \\(x\\), and estimated \\(3^{\\frac12}\\) from the graph.",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L03-ACTIVITY-010",
      "SourceSection": "3.3: Fraction of What, Exactly?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Use the exponent rules and your understanding of roots to find the exact value of:",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l03.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
